    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Hot workpiece and oil or water bath; combination D models have separate oil/water compartments. Manual charging or optional charging aids/coolers/heaters depend on the ordered setup. A lid, supply and drain connections are described; the catalog does not enumerate an electrical state machine.
Source: I, PDF p. 86, Quenching and Cleaning Baths model table.""" .

