<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Powder/material in a selected pressing die; hand-operated separate hydraulic pump and cylinder. Transparent safety cover; optional electric/programmed pumps are separate configurations, not base-model controls. The source contains conflicting cylinder-travel figures, so no travel limit is assigned.
Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS> ;
    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Pressed sample/compact and built-in hydraulic-pressure gauge indication. Applied force is calculated from the listed gauge conversion; the base press does not itself report a digital sample-force signal. No electrical/data-output states are specified.
Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS%3Aunits_of_measure> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/GAP-20261016-M72-MTI-YLJ-24TS> ;
    schema:name "Measuring units" ;
    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """MPa (gauge pressure); metric tonne-force (applied force convention); mm/cm (die/cylinder geometry); °C (operating environment). m/s² appears only as a gravity constant in the conversion formula.
Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.""" .

