    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Dried aerosol stream; no direct contact between aerosol and desiccant. Desiccant colour provides the listed qualitative saturation indication; no electrical/data signal outputs are specified.
Source: I, German datasheet, PDF pp. 1–2.""" .

