    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Liquid sample and installed stirring tool on a fixed stand; front-knob speed selection and mains power. On/off operation; regulated normal running and overload operation. Fault protection can stop the motor.
Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M03-01%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
