    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Stirred liquid; shaft rotation and speed display. Normal display reports actual rpm; overload status 1 blinks the target speed; overload status 2 stops rotation with Er 4. Complete electrical signal outputs are not described.
Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).""" .

