<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M12-02%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M12-02> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Grinding feed and media: Organic/inorganic samples; grinding bowls and balls selected for feed material; states: Dry grinding or wet grinding; media/compatibility are configuration-dependent; phase: Dry solid, emulsion or suspension as specified
Mains input: 100–240 V ±10%; approx. 10 A at 115 V or 5 A at 230 V; maximum power approximately 1100 W; states: Mains off/on; voltage-change procedure and restart protection apply
Program parameters: Speed up to 1100 rpm; time up to 999 min; pause up to 99 min; cycles up to 99; states: Numeric program entries; starts only after bowl/closing checks
Cover and bowl sensing: Sensors check grinding bowls and cover mechanism; states: Bowl detected/not detected; stationary-drive/cover conditions; safety checks before starting
Additional documented controls/states: lid opening/locking control.
Source: Manuals/FRITSCH PULVERISETTE 7 premium line__linked-manual__34deccc603.pdf, PDF p. 18.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M12-02%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
