    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Ground sample: Manual reports dry d50 <20 µm and wet d50 <0.1 µm depending on material; states: Ground material; actual size requires measurement and depends on process; phase: Dry powder or wet suspension
Operating/fault indication: Display signals overload; drive stops for overheating, blockage or excessive imbalance; states: Grinding; paused/stopped; reduced-speed overload; thermal/blockage/imbalance shutdown; no automatic restart after power loss""" .

