<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M18-06%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M18-06> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Materials/workload: Material to be dried; heat and vacuum connections/conditions.
Documented parameters/utilities: Temperature setting/range (°C; °F), Pressure setting/range (mbar), Electrical supply (V).
Interfaces named: Ethernet, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: gas stream.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 19, 93, 152.""" .

