    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Load placed in the laboratory furnace, electrical heating supply and controller temperature program. The family manual describes a closed chamber with heated ceramic plates and thermocouple feedback; exact controller guards and utility rating depend on the model/rating plate.
