    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Substrate, deposition precursors/process gases, RF plasma power, multi-zone temperature program, four-channel gas delivery and vacuum pumping. The linked product is a PE-CVD system, not evidence of an atomic-layer pulsing interface. Tube size and zone count depend on the variant.
Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.""" .

