<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M32-01%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M32-01> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Compatible gas, electrical supply and flow setpoint. EL-FLOW Select family manual describes analog/digital remote control and RS-232; other fieldbus interfaces depend on the ordered option. Normally-closed and normally-open valve constructions are alternatives, not interchangeable states of every unit. F-200CV-specific full-scale range is not established here.
Source: H, PDF pp. 8–11 (EL-FLOW Select family).""" .

