    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Measured/controlled gas flow plus diagnostics, alarms and counters; analog/digital communication depends on the ordered interface. Exact scaling, valve option and complete signal-state map require the serial-label configuration.
Source: H, PDF pp. 8–11 (EL-FLOW Select family).""" .

