Interfaces named: USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: liquid sample.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 81, 174.
Additional documented controls/states: start/stop controls.
Source: Manuals/Malvern Zetasizer Nano ZS__linked-manual__4bcf5b5713.pdf, PDF p. 31, 55.""" .

