    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Sample/reference in appropriate UV-Vis cells or installed solid-sample accessories; wavelength scan, variable slit width, signal averaging/integration and photometric method. Temperature-controlled cell hardware and reflectance/film accessories are options, not assumed installed. The brochure identifies Cary 100 operation at 190–900 nm; electrical/control-state maps are not provided.
Source: Manuals/Agilent Cary 100.pdf, PDF pp. 2, 4–10.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M35-05%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
