    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Absorbance/transmittance versus wavelength; kinetics and optional accessory-dependent reflectance, film or colour analysis. The Cary 100 working absorbance range is described as beyond 4 Abs; the Cary 300’s 6 Abs claim is not assigned to this row.
Source: Manuals/Agilent Cary 100.pdf, PDF pp. 2, 4–10.""" .

