    schema:value """W (laser-power specification on the linked standard LUMEX Avance-25 page). The page lists a standard 500 W laser; applicability to the existing/reactive inventory configurations is unconfirmed. Other operating/measurement units were not recovered from this page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-008%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-008> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Metal powder feed, substrate/build plate and CAD/build instructions; hybrid processing also requires milling tools and a machining program. The inventory describes laser powder-bed fusion combined with subtractive machining. The reactive configuration and its gas, interlock and control limits are not specified by the linked standard-product page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-008%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-008> ;
    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Hybrid additively built and milled metal component. The inventory identifies specimen/part fabrication; detailed process telemetry and ready/alarm outputs require the installed controller manual.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-008%3Aunits_of_measure> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-008> ;
