    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """W (laser-power specification on the linked standard LUMEX Avance-25 page). The page lists a standard 500 W laser; applicability to the existing/reactive inventory configurations is unconfirmed. Other operating/measurement units were not recovered from this page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-009%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-009> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Metal powder feed, substrate and laser toolpath/G-code; the cited experiment uses Inconel 625 powder (45–106 µm). The reported L2 configuration has a 2 kW CW fibre laser with a 1.2 mm spot. Set/recorded process inputs include laser power, XYZ position, A/C angles, scan velocity, powder-disc speed, shield/carrier-gas flow and infill/contour flags (0/1). These are the study configuration, not guaranteed limits of the Purdue machine.
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-009%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-009> ;
    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Deposited metal part. In the documented L2 sensing configuration, logged outputs include elapsed program time, layer number, infill/contour flags, feed velocity, XYZ/A/C position, laser power, melt-pool diameter, enclosure temperature, powder-disc speed and gas flows. Melt-pool sensing requires the study’s installed monitoring hardware; later CT porosity is an external test, not an L2 output.
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-009%3Aunits_of_measure> a schema:PropertyValue ;
