    schema:name "Measuring units" ;
    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """s (time); mm and µm (position/spot/powder size); mm/min (scan velocity); degrees (A/C axes); W or kW (laser power); J/mm² (derived specific laser energy density); °C (enclosure temperature); rpm (powder-disc speed); L/min (shield/carrier gas); Hz (logging rate); layer index and 0/1 flags (dimensionless)
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.""" .

