<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-012%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-012> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Material inputs: metal powder, e.g. zinc, aluminium, copper, nickel or tin, and a substrate. Utilities: single-phase 230 V / 16 A and compressed air approximately 400 L/min. Manufacturer lists 5–8 bar operating pressure; the Dymet page lists 6–8 bar, so confirm the installed system rating. Operating mode: manual spraying or CNC integration. Dymet lists gas-temperature operation at 100–600 °C; detailed command/pin states are not supplied.
Source: H and I, CSM 108.2 product specifications; reviewed 2026-10-30.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-012%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-012> ;
    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Cold-sprayed metal coating or built-up workpiece; gas/powder jet exits the spray nozzle. Deposited thickness and quality depend on feedstock and settings. Neither linked product page gives an electrical output/telemetry-state map.
Source: H and I, CSM 108.2 product specifications; reviewed 2026-10-30.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-012%3Aunits_of_measure> a schema:PropertyValue ;
