    schema:name "Measuring units" ;
    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """bar (air pressure); L/min or m³/min (airflow); °C (gas-temperature specification); V and A (electrical supply); m/s (particle speed listed by Dymet). These are operating/specification quantities; no integrated readout or signal scaling is established.
Source: H and I, CSM 108.2 product specifications; reviewed 2026-10-30.""" .

