    schema:value """Six-axis tool motion; absolute serial encoder position feedback and wrist end-effector connection are described. Axis brakes and solenoid valve pack are listed, but their command/state mapping is not supplied.
Source: I, LR Mate 200i Details, Motion Speed and Motion Range.""" .

