    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Arm/tool motion and controller indications. The manual lists VP_ENABLE, VP_MODEKEY, VP_MOTOPB and Collision_Avoidance in its predefined output-signal table; Collision_Avoidance uses 1=enabled, 0=disabled. Mode/position indications are available; the complete configured I/O map is not given.
Source: H, PDF pp. 19–28, 32, 35, 39, 50–51.""" .

