    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Multilayer MXene powder in a solvent such as water, held in an appropriate vessel; mechanical shaking. Shaking speed, time, payload, utilities and control states are not specified by the custom inventory entry.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx, corresponding synthesis/deposition or testing inventory entry.""" .

