    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """kg (wrist payload and robot mass); mm (reach/repeatability); degrees (joint motion ranges); mm/s (collaborative/high-speed mode Cartesian speed); N·m (allowable wrist moment); kg·m² (wrist inertia); VAC (input power-source voltage). The sheet specifies 10 kg wrist payload, 1249 mm reach and ±0.04 mm repeatability. These are datasheet units; the complete controller-unit and electrical pin/state map is not supplied.
Source: Manuals2/CRX-10iA_Technical_Specifications_Datasheet.pdf, PDF p. 1.""" .

