<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3%3Ainputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3> ;
    schema:name "Input and input states" ;
    schema:propertyID "inputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Optical input through the SMA fibre connector; acquisition integration time, averaging and trigger selection from the host PC over USB or serial connection. USB provides power. Normal/free-run, external synchronous, external hardware-level and external hardware-edge triggering are documented. DD4 pin 2 accepts the external TTL trigger (5 or 3.3 V as specified); GPIO pins are not 5 V tolerant. Exact Flame-S/Flame-T detector, slit and wavelength configuration is unspecified in this row.
Source: Manuals/Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer (configuration unspecified)__linked-manual__aa2aa40792.pdf, PDF pp. 12, 15, 21–26, 35, 55, 59–61, 65–67.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3%3Aoutputs_and_states> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3> ;
    schema:name "Output and output states" ;
    schema:propertyID "outputs_and_states" ;
    schema:value """Wavelength-resolved spectra and derived absorbance/reflectance/emission through the host software, subject to calibration. Red LED steady=powered; green LED steady=ready and flashing=acquiring. Single/continuous strobe, lamp-enable, configurable GPIO and serial transmit are documented at the DD4 interface. Pin voltages/directions vary; refer to the pin table rather than treating every signal as 5 V TTL.
Source: Manuals/Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer (configuration unspecified)__linked-manual__aa2aa40792.pdf, PDF pp. 12, 15, 21–26, 35, 55, 59–61, 65–67.""" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3%3Aunits_of_measure> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3> ;
    schema:name "Measuring units" ;
    schema:propertyID "units_of_measure" ;
    schema:value """nm (wavelength/resolution); µm (slit width); µs, ms and s (integration/trigger timing); Hz (scan rate); V and mA (electrical interface/power); detector counts and configured logic states (dimensionless). Detector-specific integration ranges must not be merged between Flame-S and Flame-T.
Source: Manuals/Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer (configuration unspecified)__linked-manual__aa2aa40792.pdf, PDF pp. 12, 15, 21–26, 35, 55, 59–61, 65–67.""" .

