<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/EXT-M70-OPENTRONS-GEN2> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Opentrons Thermocycler Module GEN2 — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "EXT-M70-OPENTRONS-GEN2" ;
    dct:references <https://docs.opentrons.com/thermocycler/>,
        <https://docs.opentrons.com/thermocycler/product-specs/> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """Sample plate: Loaded compatible plate and its liquid samples; states: Labware loaded or absent; sample chemistry is protocol-specific; phase: Liquid samples in wells
Block temperature target: 4–99 °C; states: Numeric target; blocking and concurrent variants are documented
Lid temperature target: 37–110 °C; states: Heater enabled at target or deactivated; lowering target uses passive cooling
Temperature profile: Temperature/hold-time steps; repetition count; block_max_volume; states: Ordered profile steps; 25 µL default block_max_volume is an API parameter, not machine capacity
API control methods: open_lid, close_lid, set/start_set_lid_temperature, set/start_set_block_temperature, execute/start_execute_profile, deactivate/deactivate_block/deactivate_lid; states: Open/close requests; configure/run; controller active/deactivated; API-version dependent""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription "command; enum; min; repetition count; s; state; well count; °C; µL" ;
    icon:outputDescription """Lid position: lid_position property; states: open; closed; in_between; unknown; optional None per API signature
Block temperature and status: block_temperature; block_temperature_status; states: holding at target; cooling; heating; idle; error
Lid temperature and status: lid_temperature; lid_temperature_status; states: holding at target; passive cooling; heating; idle; error; optional None
LED indication: White/orange/red/blue, solid or pulsing as specified; states: White=idle (may remain hot); pulsing orange=error; red=hot; blue=cool; solid=holding, pulsing=changing for red/blue
Temperature-cycled samples: Samples remain in the loaded labware; states: Thermal history follows the chosen protocol; yield/composition not determined by the module specification; phase: Protocol-dependent liquid samples""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "Opentrons Thermocycler Module GEN2" ;
    icon:sourceRow "746" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

