<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M07-01> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "New Era NE-300 InfusionONE — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "M07-01" ;
    dct:references <https://www.syringepump.com/NE-300.php>,
        <https://www.syringepump.com/download/NE-300%20Just%20Infusion%20User%20Manual.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """Syringe contents: Sample in a compatible syringe; compatibility not specified; states: Loaded syringe; phase: Fluid; composition not prescribed
DC input: 12 V DC; 750 mA maximum; specified regulated adapter rated 1000 mA; states: Connected/disconnected
Syringe diameter: 0.100–50.00 mm; states: Set while stopped
Infusion rate: 0.73 µL/h (1 mL B-D syringe) to 1257 mL/h (60 mL B-D syringe); states: Numeric rate; 0.0 stops pumping; limits depend on syringe
Start/stop and purge keys: Start/Stop key and reverse-purge key; states: Stopped, infusion, forward purge, reverse purge; held-key purge stops on release
Power-failure restart and low-noise modes: Independent binary setup options; states: 0=disabled; 1=enabled""" ;
