<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M23-09> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Denton Discovery 18 — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "M23-09" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """Substrate and sputter targets; process-gas supply, vacuum-pump connections and RF/DC sputtering power. The brochure lists two 2-inch magnetron cathodes with independent shutters, 500 W RF and 1 kW DC supplies, and substrate rotation adjustable from 0 to 25 rpm. A microprocessor PLC controls vacuum valves and auto-pump/auto-vent sequencing with software interlocks. The optional DVO/CS automation package is not assumed installed.
Source: Manuals/Discovery-18.pdf, PDF pp. 1 and 4, visually reviewed.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription """Torr (vacuum pressure); L/s and cfm (pumping speed); rpm (substrate rotation); W/kW (RF/DC power); V and A (DC supply rating); in (target/substrate geometry).
Source: Manuals/Discovery-18.pdf, PDF pp. 1 and 4, visually reviewed.""" ;
    icon:outputDescription """Sputtered coating on the substrate; digital mass-flow and vacuum-pressure readouts. Valve/pump/vent and shutter operation are described, but the brochure does not enumerate the electrical ready/alarm/pin-state map.
Source: Manuals/Discovery-18.pdf, PDF pp. 1 and 4, visually reviewed.""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "Denton Discovery 18" ;
    icon:sourceRow "270" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

