<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-027> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Gamry corrosion cell — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "REQ-EQ-027" ;
    dct:references <https://www.gamry.com/assets/Uploads/MultiPort-Manual-Rev1-4.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """The linked source is the MultiPort cell kit: electrolyte, a metal working-electrode specimen, graphite counter electrode and a separately selected reference electrode. Optional purge/blanket gas requires a vent; the cell is not a pressure vessel. Optional jacket accepts circulating bath fluid; spare ports accept a thermometer/pH probe or reactant addition. Electrode leads connect to a separate potentiostat. Gas modes are purge, blanket and vent; no electronic command-state map is provided for the passive cell.
Source: H, MultiPort Cell Kit manual, PDF pp. 8, 13, 17–19, 23–26.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription """mL (MultiPort standard operating volume: 1000 mL); cm² or in² (nominal gasket-covered electrode area); mm/in (specimen geometry). Voltage, current, impedance, temperature and pH units/ranges depend on separately installed measuring instruments.
Source: H, MultiPort Cell Kit manual, PDF pp. 8, 13, 17–19, 23–26.""" ;
    icon:outputDescription """Electrode potential/current response is conveyed to the connected potentiostat; corrosion/impedance results depend on that instrument and method. The passive cell itself does not acquire or export digital measurements. Purge gas exits the vent; the reacted electrolyte/specimen remain in the cell. The unspecified inventory row does not confirm the MultiPort model or an eight-channel potentiostat.
Source: H, MultiPort Cell Kit manual, PDF pp. 8, 13, 17–19, 23–26.""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "Gamry corrosion cell" ;
    icon:sourceRow "12" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

