<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-040> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Light Conversion CARBIDE CB1-04 — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "REQ-EQ-040" ;
    dct:references <https://lightcon.com/wp-content/uploads/datasheets/LC-Scientific-Interface-Module-for-CARBIDE-260601.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """PARTIAL FAMILY REFERENCE — installed CB1-04 controller not verified. The manual’s safety-shutter declaration expressly includes CARBIDE CB1 among the listed families. For the documented shutter subsystem, control is by shutter switch or software; interruption of the remote-interlock circuit is abnormal and requires a manual reset or software reset to restore shutter operation. Use this as family-level safety evidence only: the exact CB1-04 power, cooling, trigger and control-pin inputs remain unestablished.
Source: Manuals2/CARBIDE-CB3-80W-User-Manual (1).pdf, PDF pp. 84–89 and 107.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription "CPA-based Yb:KGW Femtosecond / Picosecond Laser; 1028 nm – 1030 nm; Tunable from 290 fs to 10 ps; Pulse energy > 100 µJ; Repetition rate 100 kHz to 1000 kHz; Power requirements 110 to 220 VAC, 50/60 Hz (up to 300 W max draw);" ;
    icon:outputDescription """PARTIAL FAMILY REFERENCE — installed CB1-04 controller not verified. The listed safety function is emergency-stop activation on shutter failure. In the documented safety-shutter subsystem, a detected failure interrupts SHUTTER ERROR OUTPUTS; an external power-switching/emergency-stop circuit is needed to remove laser power, and shutter function is restored by a complete controller power cycle. Exact CB1-04 laser-output specifications, connector levels and status-pin mappings are not established; CB3-80W performance limits were not transferred.
Source: Manuals2/CARBIDE-CB3-80W-User-Manual (1).pdf, PDF pp. 84–89 and 107.""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "Light Conversion CARBIDE CB1-04" ;
    icon:sourceRow "14" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-041> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "SYNRAD Series48 Model 48-1 — input/output metadata" ;
