    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """DC electrical power, specified cooling and external CTRL PWM command. Command LOW 0–0.5 VDC=beam off; HIGH 3.5–10 VDC=beam on, subject to interlocks/faults. Standard PWM 5 kHz, maximum 20 kHz; duty cycle controls power. Analog 0–10 V / 4–20 mA control requires a UC-2000 intermediary.
Source: H, PDF pp. 16, 38–39, 44–49.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription """V DC; kHz/Hz (PWM repetition); % (duty cycle); µs (pulse timing); °C/°F (thermal conditions); µm (optical wavelength); mA (UC-2000-mediated analog control)
Source: H, PDF pp. 16, 38–39, 44–49.""" ;
    icon:outputDescription """CO₂ laser beam (enabled/disabled by gating, shutter/interlocks and fault shutdown). Temperature warning at DB-9 pin 5 goes LOW at 54±2 °C and remains low until temperature drops below the specified reset threshold. Other outputs depend on connector/model configuration.
Source: H, PDF pp. 16, 38–39, 44–49.""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "SYNRAD Series48 Model 48-1" ;
    icon:sourceRow "28" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-042> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Universal Robots UR12e — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "REQ-EQ-042" ;
    dct:references <https://www.universal-robots.com/manuals/EN/HTML/SW5_20/Content/prod-usr-man/complianceUR12e/H_g5_sections/appendix_g5/tech_spec_data_12e.htm>,
        <https://www.universal-robots.com/manuals/EN/PDF/SW5_25_1/user-manual-UR12e-PDF_online/733-429-00_UR12e_User_Manual_en_Global.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """End effector and workpiece: Tool/workpiece load within the model payload and center-of-gravity envelope; states: Configured payload and center of gravity; workpiece state depends on attached tool; phase: Not prescribed by robot manual
Control-box digital/safety/configurable inputs: PNP; input voltage −3–30 V; states: OFF region −3–5 V; ON region 11–30 V; 5–11 V is not a valid guaranteed logic region
Control-box analog inputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current mode selected in GUI
Tool digital inputs: PNP with weak pull-down; floating input reads LOW; states: LOW ≤2.0 V; HIGH ≥5.5 V within permitted input range −0.5–26 V
Robot motion/program configuration: Joint/TCP moves, payload and tool/installation settings in PolyScope; states: Program/installation dependent; this extract does not enumerate all PolyScope commands or safety functions
Additional documented controls/states: manual/automatic operating mode, remote/local control.
Source: Manuals/Universal Robots UR12e__linked-manual__76e09f695d.pdf, PDF p. 21, 25.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription "A; V; bit; joint count; kg; m/s; mA; mm; °; °/s; Ω" ;
    icon:outputDescription """Control-box analog outputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current output mode selected; range and load constraints apply
Control-box digital outputs: PNP; current 0–1 A with specified loads; states: HIGH/LOW; voltage drop and leakage limits given in manual
Tool digital outputs: Sinking NPN, sourcing PNP or push/pull; states: NPN active=LOW/inactive=open; PNP active=HIGH/inactive=open; push/pull active=HIGH/inactive=LOW; emergency stop=high impedance
Tool power supply: Selectable 0/12/24 V; specified single-/dual-pin current limits; states: Off, 12 V or 24 V; dual-pin mode changes output-pin availability
Tool/workpiece motion: Six-joint robot motion within configured workspace; states: Trajectory and stop conditions are program/safety-configuration dependent; phase: Workpiece phase is not prescribed""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "Universal Robots UR12e" ;
    icon:sourceRow "29" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-043> a icon:InputOutputProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Tracer 2.0 Mobile Platform — input/output metadata" ;
    dct:identifier "REQ-EQ-043" ;
    dct:references <https://static.generation-robots.com/media/user-manual-tracer-2-0-agilex-robotics.pdf> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv> ;
    icon:importedDate "2026-10-30" ;
    icon:inputDescription """Workload: payload mounted on the mobile base (rated 100 kg). Power: 24 V battery. Commands: forward/reverse linear velocity and left/right angular velocity through CAN 2.0B at 500 kbit/s or the RC handset; emergency stop must be released. Feedback modes are standby=0x00, CAN=0x01 and RC=0x02. RC takes priority over CAN. Motion-command timeout after 500 ms sets velocity to zero.
Source: H, PDF pp. 3, 7–8, 11–19, 22–26, 34.""" ;
    icon:measuringUnitsDescription """mm/s (CAN linear velocity); 0.001 rad/s (CAN angular-velocity scaling); m/s (rated travel speed); rpm (motor feedback); V (battery, reported with ×10 integer scaling); A (motor current); °C (temperature); kg (payload); ms (command timing); kbit/s (CAN bitrate); coded/Boolean status flags (dimensionless)
Source: H, PDF pp. 3, 7–8, 11–19, 22–26, 34.""" ;
    icon:outputDescription """Chassis translation/rotation; CAN feedback for actual linear/angular velocity, battery voltage, chassis/control-mode status, fault bits and motor information. Fault bits use 0=normal/no alarm and 1=fault/alarm. Feedback motor speed is in rpm; the side interface also provides 24 V expansion power.
Source: H, PDF pp. 3, 7–8, 11–19, 22–26, 34.""" ;
    icon:sourceModel "AgileX Robotics Tracer 2.0 Mobile Platform" ;
    icon:sourceRow "3" ;
    icon:sourceSha256 "c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab" ;
    icon:sourceSheet "Sheet1" .

